OL,3,GNEWSALights festival and market to open
OL,4,Afestive season
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxford is preparing to be transformed
OL,7,Ffor a weekend of Christmas lights and
OL,8,Ffestive events.
OL,10,FThe Christmas Light Festival, from 13
OL,11,Fto 15 November, will feature hand-made
OL,12,Flanterns, LED displays, street
OL,13,Fdecorations and colourful window art
OL,14,Fthroughout the city.
OL,16,FA four-day Victorian Christmas Market
OL,17,Fon Broad Street also started on
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
