OL,3,GNEWSALights festival and market to open
OL,4,Afestive season
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity council leader Susan Brown said
OL,7,Fthe annual lights festival brought
OL,8,Fcommunities, cultures and businesses
OL,9,Ftogether for an event that "brightens
OL,10,Fup Oxford through a magical light
OL,11,Fspectacle".
